#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:32 4cebe592fb5c420b96335a685d8fe5c4
msgid ""
"**Description**: Perform gene set enrichment (overrepresentation) "
"analysis using PANTHER. Given a gene list, identifies statistically "
"enriched GO terms, PANTHER pathways, Reactome pathways, or protein "
"classes using Fisher's exact test with FDR correction. PANTHER is one of "
"the most widely used tools for functional enrichment in bioinformatics. "
"Example: gene list 'TP53,BRCA1,EGFR,KRAS,PTEN' enriched for GO "
"biological\\_process returns 'regulation of mitotic cell cycle phase "
"transition' (FDR=0.003)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:71
#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:105 0c8713e7385541d4be67b8b71b02bcaf
#: b9f1d28e707b48bb8c796a919d0557bd ed5462585b37494f88b28ab68f89ea7e
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:36 17105bb6075c4481aad08960c56952ab
msgid ""
"``gene_list`` (string) (required) Comma-separated list of gene symbols, "
"UniProt IDs, or Ensembl IDs. Example: "
"'TP53,BRCA1,EGFR,KRAS,PTEN,APC,RB1'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:39 eca71980863041b9a4e5c32b936ddcc5
msgid ""
"``organism`` (integer, null) (optional) NCBI taxonomy ID. Default: 9606 "
"(human). Others: 10090 (mouse), 7227 (fly), 559292 (yeast)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:42 cdef22cdf3194624aa4d0cda8b81ff46
msgid ""
"``annotation_dataset`` (string, null) (optional) Annotation dataset for "
"enrichment. Options: 'GO:0008150' (biological\\_process, default), "
"'GO:0003674' (molecular\\_function), 'GO:0005575' (cellular\\_component),"
" 'ANNOT\\_TYPE\\_ID\\_PANTHER\\_PATHWAY' (PANTHER pathway), "
"'ANNOT\\_TYPE\\_ID\\_REACTOME\\_PATHWAY' (Reactome pathway), "
"'ANNOT\\_TYPE\\_ID\\_PANTHER\\_PC' (protein class)."
msgstr ""

