#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:69 45a2b48e671d4825a8a4d26ed42176b6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get gene classification and functional annotation from "
"PANTHER (Protein ANalysis THrough Evolutionary Relationships). Returns "
"PANTHER family/subfamily, Gene Ontology annotations (molecular function, "
"biological process, cellular component), PANTHER protein class, and "
"pathway membership. PANTHER classifies genes by evolutionary "
"relationships across 144 organisms. Example: P04637 returns TP53 "
"classified in family PTHR11447 (tumor protein p53) with GO annotations "
"for DNA-binding transcription factor activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:73 8908589496044c21bea83a3d8e6eb4fc
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) Gene identifier - UniProt accession, "
"Ensembl ID, or gene symbol. Examples: 'P04637' (TP53), 'P38398' (BRCA1), "
"'ENSG00000141510'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:76 f3044435e0344b2f8a3021ac73be6051
msgid ""
"``organism`` (integer, null) (optional) NCBI taxonomy ID. Default: 9606 "
"(human). Others: 10090 (mouse), 10116 (rat), 7227 (fly), 6239 (worm), "
"559292 (yeast)."
msgstr ""

