#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:95 6b44198bc8da435893d8dcff41c38b92
msgid ""
"Find orthologs of a gene across species using PANTHER evolutionary "
"classification. Returns the or..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst 220b6b4f83e74310ac3e88ad7045271d
msgid "PANTHER_ortholog tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:101 ac1c06782dd0485baead218ebf40f25b
msgid "**Name**: ``PANTHER_ortholog``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:103 475ec9053a884ade806c269bc9a19196
msgid ""
"**Description**: Find orthologs of a gene across species using PANTHER "
"evolutionary classification. Returns the orthologous gene in a target "
"species with its persistent ID, gene symbol, and ortholog type (LDO=Least"
" Diverged Ortholog, O=ortholog, P=paralog, X=xenolog, LDX=least diverged "
"xenolog). PANTHER classifies orthologs by evolutionary divergence across "
"144 fully sequenced genomes. Example: P04637 (human TP53) maps to Tp53 "
"(mouse P02340) as LDO."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:107 652bfc0a23994052be1a140063bcd7fe
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) Gene identifier - UniProt accession, "
"Ensembl ID, or gene symbol. Examples: 'P04637' (TP53), 'P38398' (BRCA1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:110 90f828b7818744d783023e9f260c81be
msgid ""
"``organism`` (integer, null) (optional) Source organism NCBI taxonomy ID."
" Default: 9606 (human)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:113 d65ac9dda6fc44468cb972977b6c679c
msgid ""
"``target_organism`` (integer, null) (optional) Target organism NCBI "
"taxonomy ID. Default: 10090 (mouse). Others: 10116 (rat), 7227 (fly), "
"6239 (worm)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/panther_tools.rst:116 d8193a4068434a9aafff029ceafe9faa
msgid ""
"``ortholog_type`` (string, null) (optional) Ortholog type filter. "
"Options: 'LDO' (least diverged ortholog, default), 'O' (all orthologs), "
"'P' (paralogs), 'X' (xenologs), 'LDX' (least diverged xenolog), 'all' "
"(all types)."
msgstr ""

